8. VALIDATION REQUIREMENT
   Any Instance claiming to be a "reposell public listing" or
   "reposell-compatible" MUST pass continuous validation:
   
   a) CI workflow `verify.yml` MUST pass on every deployment;
   
   b) Runtime MUST verify official pricing policy on startup;
   
   c) Runtime MUST enter safe state if verification fails;
   
   d) `acc check` MUST report no ACC0xx errors;
   
   e) The official protocol test suite MUST pass;
   
   f) Fee calculation MUST match official accounting test:
      For $50 product, $5 fee, 50/50 split:
      Repository owner: $45, Main listing: $2.50, Public listing: $2.50
      **Note:** Community referral economics are not yet implemented.
      The Main/Public splits are reserved for future use.

